      ":question/problem": "![](images/a5/a5ea7187f709abd8400482b7a239ac8946aa8e092001099e6dfa3af9e9e85306.png)\n\nRichard took a walk around the botanical garden. He started at the entrance and walked for $5$ hours. Using a map of the park, he recorded his distance from the entrance every hour. The results are shown above.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding Richard's walk?\n\n1. After $2$ hours, he was at his maximum distance from the entrance.\n2. After $5$ hours, his distance from the entrance was $4$ kilometers.\n3. His distance from the entrance after $3$ hours and $4$ hours was the same."
